  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The Near-Clip Plane \"Forced\" setting can break in larger worlds. The game still lets you set it however, giving you a warning and resetting on world change.\n\nI'd like a setting to allow scaling below 20cm, but with a similar warning and also resetting on world change.\n\nThis way, people wouldn't scale down without knowing they might not be able to use their menu. And even if that does happen, it will fix itself as the setting turns off on world change.\n\nAnother idea for this:\n\nHave minimum and maximum scaling be a User-Defined setting, and if you try to set it below 20cm it warns you.",
